{#- The one-workspace flow, drawn simply (founder, 2026-11-26): chat with the
    model and/or the team; spin up a project; tasks and workflows (from a chat
    or a project); reports and dashboards (from a chat or a project, tied to
    the tasks and workflows or standalone). Outcome Services is its own
    environment that contains all of those components, so it sits below the
    line and loops back into it. The steps under the map explain each one;
    keep the two in step. Outcome Services is NOT built yet: the box says so. -#}
{%- macro ico(d) -%}<svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="{{ d }}"/></svg>{%- endmacro -%}
<figure class="ent-map" aria-label="The workspace flows from chat to project, to tasks and workflows, to reports and dashboards. Outcome Services is its own environment that contains all of them, and loops back into the flow.">
  <i class="ent-rail rt"></i><i class="ent-rail rm"></i><i class="ent-rail rb"></i>
  <i class="ent-rail lt"></i><i class="ent-rail lm"></i><i class="ent-rail lb"></i>
  <ol class="ent-map-row" role="list">
    <li><span class="ent-map-k">1</span><span class="ent-map-i">{{ ico("M4 5h16v11H9l-5 4z") }}</span><b>Chat</b></li>
    <li><span class="ent-map-k">2</span><span class="ent-map-i">{{ ico("M3 7a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h4l2 2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v8a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2z") }}</span><b>Project</b></li>
    <li><span class="ent-map-k">3</span><span class="ent-map-i">{{ ico("m4 7 2 2 3-3M4 17l2 2 3-3M13 8h7M13 18h7") }}</span><b>Tasks and workflows</b></li>
    <li><span class="ent-map-k">4</span><span class="ent-map-i">{{ ico("M4 20V10M10 20V4M16 20v-7M22 20H2") }}</span><b>Reports and dashboards</b></li>
  </ol>
  <div class="ent-map-os">
    <div class="ent-map-oh"><span class="ent-map-k">5</span><b>Outcome Services</b><em>Under construction</em></div>
    <p>Its own environment. It holds all of the above, and they act directly on the systems built and the outcomes delivered.</p>
    <ul class="ent-map-chips" role="list"><li>Chat</li><li>Project</li><li>Tasks and workflows</li><li>Reports and dashboards</li></ul>
  </div>
</figure>
